quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 444.1171875, 168.75, 455.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 470.9765625, 546.75, 516.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 532.4765625, 541.5, 560.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第三节 开通申请与审批\n\n在IT服务台提交企业VPN开通申请，填写企业账号、所属业务和访问原因。申请中可以写明需要访问的内部系统，但不要因此认为对应系统的角色会同步授予。服务台根据申请执行审核与开通，审批通过后方可按通知使用。\n\n申请提交、申请获批和实际开通是不同状态。尚未收到开通结果时，不应反复尝试其他人的账号。申请被退回时，应根据缺失项补充真实业务说明；", "rrf_score": 0.029514, "bm25_score": 5.897397, "vector_score": 0.496671}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第四条 不同材料之间的关系"], "token_count": 144, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 600.1171875, 191.75, 611.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 626.9765625, 541.5, 672.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第四条 不同材料之间的关系\n\n费用报销提交期限、费用金额标准和支付处理时间属于不同事项。住宿限额应查阅住宿制度，不能用本制度的提交期限推算住宿额度；本文也不规定年假、工资、社保或税务处理方法。资料没有给出的事项，应补充相应制度再确认。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 6.51688, "vector_score": 0.453302}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 2.164705, "vector_score": 0.55601}, {"doc_id": "D01", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度甲", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度甲", "第五条 报销提交期限"], "token_count": 237, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 184.6171875, 157.25, 196.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 211.4765625, 541.5, 256.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D01-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D01_费用报销制度甲_原生.pdf", "sha256": "e44b5b4ce13137c381e6910f5304e7b8a583e6dd84756e9c49fdf5520fcd7933", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.0, 272.9765625, 541.5, 318.4765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第五条 报销提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后30个自然日。报销申请应提交发票和费用说明。自然日包含周末和节假日，不能直接理解为30个工作日。本文未给出节假日顺延、超期豁免或跨年度延期的批准规则；遇到这些情形时，需要补充制度依据。\n\n申请单应分别记录费用发生日期、实际支付日期、发票开具日期与系统提交日期。不同日期可能不一致，不能为了使申请落在期限内而修改真实日", "rrf_score": 0.015625, "bm25_score": 1.8479, "vector_score": 0.538344}]}}
